&lt;p&gt;黑色 · 烟晶 · 接骨木&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://mizjeannie.com/almanac"&gt;在Miz Jeannie上规划这一天 →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Today's Correspondences for November 14, 2026. Color: Black — protection, banishing, boundaries, clearing. Crystal: Smoky Quartz — grounding, clearing, protection, release. Herb: Elder (Sambucus nigra) — protection, thresholds, healing, ancestor-work. The graphic also explains why each fits today's almanac context." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af840967e0e5.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:06:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚特兰大出城交通拥堵</title><link>https://some.pics/6af83ad788056</link><description>&lt;p&gt;驶出亚特兰大的交通堵得水泄不通。我真庆幸是我儿子在开车！我简直无法想象住在这一带的人每天是怎么应对这种状况的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A view of heavy traffic on an Atlanta highway, with multiple lanes of cars backed up beneath a series of concrete overpasses. A large electronic traffic sign hangs above the roadway, while a bright blue sky and scattered clouds are visible in the background." height="3191" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6af83ad788056.jpg" width="4786"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:41:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>山羊道上竟有山羊</title><link>https://some.pics/6af83a08bec11</link><description>&lt;p&gt;甚至山羊小径上还有一只山羊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Zwarte geit" height="3000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/simondh/6af83a08bec11.jpg" width="4000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://simondh.some.pics"&gt;@simondh&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:38:07 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>